#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"How to create a parallel transpilation program and deploy it to IBM Quantum "
"Platform to use as a reusable remote service."
msgstr ""
"Cara membuat program transpilasi selari dan menyebarkannya ke IBM Quantum "
"Platform untuk digunakan sebagai perkhidmatan jauh yang boleh digunakan "
"semula."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: sidebar_label
#, no-wrap
msgid "Write your first Qiskit Serverless program"
msgstr "Tulis program Qiskit Serverless pertama anda"

