#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Package versions\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Versi pakej\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The code on this page was developed using the following requirements.\n"
"We recommend using these versions or newer.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kod pada halaman ini dibangunkan menggunakan keperluan berikut.\n"
"Kami mengesyorkan penggunaan versi ini atau yang lebih baharu.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"**Qiskit Serverless is getting an upgrade, and its features are changing fast.** During this development phase, find release notes and the most recent documentation at the [Qiskit Serverless GitHub](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-serverless/index.html) page.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"**Qiskit Serverless sedang menerima naik taraf, dan ciri-cirinya berubah dengan pantas.** Sepanjang fasa pembangunan ini, dapatkan nota keluaran dan dokumentasi terkini di halaman [Qiskit Serverless GitHub](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-serverless/index.html).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This example demonstrates how to use `qiskit-serverless` tools to create a "
"parallel transpilation program, and then implement `qiskit-ibm-catalog` to "
"upload your program to IBM Quantum Platform to use as a reusable remote "
"service.\n"
msgstr ""
"Contoh ini menunjukkan cara menggunakan alat `qiskit-serverless` untuk "
"membuat program transpilasi selari, kemudian menggunakan `qiskit-ibm-"
"catalog` untuk memuat naik program anda ke IBM Quantum Platform agar boleh "
"digunakan sebagai perkhidmatan jauh yang boleh digunakan semula.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Workflow overview {#workflow-overview}"
msgstr "Gambaran keseluruhan aliran kerja {#workflow-overview}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Create a local directory and empty program file "
"(`./source_files/transpile_remote.py`)\n"
msgstr ""
"Cipta direktori tempatan dan fail program kosong "
"(`./source_files/transpile_remote.py`)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Add code to your program that, when uploaded to Qiskit Serverless, will "
"transpile a circuit\n"
msgstr ""
"Tambah kod ke program anda yang, apabila dimuat naik ke Qiskit Serverless, "
"akan mentranspil litar\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Use `qiskit-ibm-catalog` to authenticate to Qiskit Serverless\n"
msgstr "Gunakan `qiskit-ibm-catalog` untuk mengesahkan ke Qiskit Serverless\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Upload the program to Qiskit Serverless\n"
msgstr "Muat naik program ke Qiskit Serverless\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"After uploading your program , you can run it to transpile the circuit by "
"following the [Run your first Qiskit Serverless workload "
"remotely](/guides/serverless-run-first-workload) guide.\n"
msgstr ""
"Selepas memuat naik program anda, anda boleh menjalankannya untuk "
"mentranspil litar dengan mengikuti panduan [Jalankan beban kerja Qiskit "
"Serverless pertama anda dari jauh](/guides/serverless-run-first-workload).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Example: Remote transpilation with Qiskit Serverless {#example-remote-"
"transpilation-with-qiskit-serverless}"
msgstr ""
"Contoh: Transpilasi jauh dengan Qiskit Serverless {#example-remote-"
"transpilation-with-qiskit-serverless}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This example walks you through creating and adding to a program file that, "
"when you upload it to Qiskit Serverless, will transpile a `circuit` against "
"a given `backend` and target `optimization_level`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Contoh ini memandu anda mencipta dan menambah ke fail program yang, apabila "
"anda memuat naiknya ke Qiskit Serverless, akan mentranspil `circuit` "
"terhadap `backend` dan `optimization_level` sasaran yang diberikan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<DoqAdmonition type=\"tip\">\n"
msgstr "<DoqAdmonition type=\"tip\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Qiskit Serverless requires setting up your workload’s `.py` files into a "
"dedicated directory. The following structure is an example of good "
"practice:\n"
msgstr ""
"Qiskit Serverless memerlukan anda menyediakan fail `.py` beban kerja ke "
"dalam direktori khusus. Struktur berikut adalah contoh amalan terbaik:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "</DoqAdmonition>\n"
msgstr "</DoqAdmonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Serverless uploads the contents of a specific directory (in this example, "
"the `source_files` directory) to run remotely. After these are set up, you "
"can adjust `transpile_remote.py` to fetch inputs and return outputs.\n"
msgstr ""
"Serverless memuat naik kandungan direktori tertentu (dalam contoh ini, "
"direktori `source_files`) untuk dijalankan dari jauh. Setelah ini "
"disediakan, anda boleh melaraskan `transpile_remote.py` untuk mengambil "
"input dan memulangkan output.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Create the directory and an empty program file {#create-the-directory-and-"
"an-empty-program-file}"
msgstr ""
"Cipta direktori dan fail program kosong {#create-the-directory-and-an-empty-"
"program-file}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"First, create a directory named `source_files`, then create a program file "
"in the directory, so that its path is `./source_files/transpile_remote.py`. "
"This is the file you will upload to Qiskit Serverless.\n"
msgstr ""
"Mula-mula, cipta direktori bernama `source_files`, kemudian cipta fail "
"program dalam direktori tersebut, supaya laluannya ialah "
"`./source_files/transpile_remote.py`. Ini ialah fail yang akan anda muat "
"naik ke Qiskit Serverless.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Add code to your program file {#add-code-to-your-program-file}"
msgstr "Tambah kod ke fail program anda {#add-code-to-your-program-file}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Populate your program file with the following code, then save it.\n"
msgstr "Isikan fail program anda dengan kod berikut, kemudian simpannya.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\">\n"
"If you're reading the code cells locally in a notebook, you will see the `%%writefile` [magic command](https://ipython.readthedocs.io/en/stable/interactive/magics.html#cellmagic-writefile). Executing cells with this magic command saves them to disk rather than executing them.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\">\n"
"Jika anda membaca sel kod secara tempatan dalam notebook, anda akan melihat [magic command](https://ipython.readthedocs.io/en/stable/interactive/magics.html#cellmagic-writefile) `%%writefile`. Melaksanakan sel dengan magic command ini menyimpannya ke cakera dan bukannya melaksanakannya.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Add code to get program arguments {#add-code-to-get-program-arguments}"
msgstr ""
"Tambah kod untuk mendapatkan argumen program {#add-code-to-get-program-"
"arguments}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now add the following code to your program file, which sets up program "
"arguments.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sekarang tambah kod berikut ke fail program anda, yang menyediakan argumen "
"program.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Your initial `transpile_remote.py` has three inputs: `circuits`, "
"`backend_name`, and `optimization_level`. Serverless is currently limited to"
" only accept serializable inputs and outputs. For this reason, you cannot "
"pass in `backend` directly, so use `backend_name` as a string instead.\n"
msgstr ""
"`transpile_remote.py` awal anda mempunyai tiga input: `circuits`, "
"`backend_name`, dan `optimization_level`. Serverless pada masa ini hanya "
"menerima input dan output yang boleh disiri. Atas sebab ini, anda tidak "
"boleh menghantar `backend` secara terus, jadi gunakan `backend_name` sebagai"
" rentetan.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Add code that calls the backend {#add-code-that-calls-the-backend}"
msgstr "Tambah kod yang memanggil Backend {#add-code-that-calls-the-backend}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Add the following code to your program file, which calls your backend with "
"`QiskitRuntimeService`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tambah kod berikut ke fail program anda, yang memanggil Backend anda dengan "
"`QiskitRuntimeService`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The following code assumes that you have already followed the process to "
"save your credentials by using `QiskitRuntimeService.save_account`, and will"
" load your default saved account unless you specify otherwise. See [Save "
"your login credentials](/guides/save-credentials) and [Initialize your "
"Qiskit Runtime service account](/guides/initialize-account) for more "
"information.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kod berikut mengandaikan bahawa anda telah mengikuti proses untuk menyimpan "
"kelayakan anda dengan menggunakan `QiskitRuntimeService.save_account`, dan "
"akan memuatkan akaun lalai yang anda simpan melainkan anda menyatakan "
"sebaliknya. Lihat [Simpan kelayakan log masuk anda](/guides/save-"
"credentials) dan [Mulakan akaun perkhidmatan Qiskit Runtime "
"anda](/guides/initialize-account) untuk maklumat lanjut.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Add code to transpile {#add-code-to-transpile}"
msgstr "Tambah kod untuk mentranspil {#add-code-to-transpile}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Finally, add the following code to your program file. This code runs "
"`transpile_remote()` across all `circuits` passed in, and returns the "
"`transpiled_circuits` as a result:\n"
msgstr ""
"Akhirnya, tambah kod berikut ke fail program anda. Kod ini menjalankan "
"`transpile_remote()` merentas semua `circuits` yang dihantar, dan "
"memulangkan `transpiled_circuits` sebagai keputusan:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"upload-to-qiskit-serverless\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"upload-to-qiskit-serverless\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Authenticate to Qiskit Serverless {#authenticate-to-qiskit-serverless}"
msgstr "Mengesahkan ke Qiskit Serverless {#authenticate-to-qiskit-serverless}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use `qiskit-ibm-catalog` to authenticate to `QiskitServerless` with your API"
" key (you can use your `QiskitRuntimeService` API key, or create a new API "
"key on the [IBM Quantum Platform "
"dashboard](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com)).\n"
msgstr ""
"Gunakan `qiskit-ibm-catalog` untuk mengesahkan ke `QiskitServerless` dengan "
"kunci API anda (anda boleh menggunakan kunci API `QiskitRuntimeService` "
"anda, atau mencipta kunci API baharu pada [papan pemuka IBM Quantum "
"Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com)).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Run code to upload {#run-code-to-upload}"
msgstr "Jalankan kod untuk memuat naik {#run-code-to-upload}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Run the following code to upload the program. Qiskit Serverless compresses "
"the contents of `working_dir` (in this case, `source_files`) into a `tar`, "
"which is uploaded and then cleaned up. The `entrypoint` identifies the main "
"program executable for Qiskit Serverless to run.\n"
msgstr ""
"Jalankan kod berikut untuk memuat naik program. Qiskit Serverless "
"memampatkan kandungan `working_dir` (dalam kes ini, `source_files`) ke dalam"
" `tar`, yang dimuat naik dan kemudian dibersihkan. `entrypoint` mengenal "
"pasti program utama yang boleh dilaksanakan untuk dijalankan oleh Qiskit "
"Serverless.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Verify upload {#verify-upload}"
msgstr "Sahkan muat naik {#verify-upload}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To check if it successfully uploaded, use `serverless.list()`, as in the "
"following code:\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk menyemak sama ada muat naik berjaya, gunakan `serverless.list()`, "
"seperti dalam kod berikut:\n"

